x and CSV download.</p>\n      <span class=\"hub-cta\">See catalogue →</span>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"hub-card\" href=\"species.html\">\n    <div class=\"hub-ph\" style=\"background-image:url('../fotos/Araucaria.jpg')\"></div>\n    <div class=\"hub-body\">\n      <h3>Featured species</h3>\n      <p>The most emblematic specimens for their botanical, historical and scenic value.</p>\n      <span class=\"hub-cta\">Explore species →</span>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"hub-card\" href=\"birds.html\">\n    <div class=\"hub-ph\" style=\"background-image:url('../fotos/galeria/ave_tijereta.jpg')\"></div>\n    <div class=\"hub-body\">\n      <h3>Birds</h3>\n      <p>Photo gallery and seasonal record of the birds observed on the estate.</p>\n      <span class=\"hub-cta\">Explore birds →</span>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"hub-card\" href=\"seedbank.html\">\n    <div class=\"hub-ph\" style=\"background-image:url('../fotos/galeria/alameda_eucaliptos.jpg')\"></div>\n    <div class=\"hub-body\">\n      <h3>Seed bank</h3>\n      <p><i>Ex-situ</i> conservation of our flora: the arboretum's seed collection.</p>\n      <span class=\"hub-cta\">See the seed bank →</span>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"hub-card\" href=\"plan.html\">\n    <div class=\"hub-ph\" style=\"background-image:url('../fotos/mapa_jardines.jpg')\"></div>\n    <div class=\"hub-body\">\n      <h3>Illustrated plan</h3>\n      <p>The hand-drawn plan of the gardens and the layout of the main collections.</p>\n      <span class=\"hub-cta\">See the plan →</span>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n\n</div>\n```\n\n::: {.callout-note}\nThe map, catalogue and species pages are shared across both languages: plant data is largely language-neutral, and scientific names are universal.\n:::\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\n```{=html}\n<style>#quarto-header,.navbar{display:none !important;}</style>\n<div class=\"en-nav\">\n  <span class=\"brand\">Arboretum</span>\n  <a href=\"index.html\">Home</a>\n  <a href=\"collectio